SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE — please read, it is not the usual boilerplate.

This MIT license covers THIS DIRECTORY ONLY: the Hermes adapter
(brainlehr_provider.py, config_schema.py, cli.py, plugin.yaml,
pyproject.toml, __init__.py and the READMEs).

It does NOT cover brainlehr itself. brainlehr is a separate program under
**AGPL-3.0**, distributed separately: https://github.com/3lehr/brainlehr

The two are separate processes. This adapter speaks to brainlehr over MCP
(stdio) and imports none of its modules — verified: the server runs under its
own PID and knowledge_mcp_server never enters this process's sys.modules.
Installing this adapter does not install brainlehr, and using it requires you
to obtain brainlehr under its own terms.
